<!--
    kuna: a signed read of an expression that prints as unsigned (AArch64).

    glibc's __sigismember (aarch64 libc.so.6 2.17 symbol version, bytes
    verbatim): `sub w1,w1,#1; sxtw x2,w1; lsr x2,x2,#6; ldr x0,[x0,x2,lsl #3]`
    indexes the set by the sign-extended `sig - 1`.  The constant prints as
    `1U`, and the sign extension printed `(unsigned long)(long)(a1 - 1U)`, a
    zero extension: sig 0 indexed word 0x3ffffff instead of word -1.  It now
    prints `(unsigned long)(int)(a1 - 1U)`.

    Stage: P9 cast placement (ActionSetCasts; p9_emit/kuna_signedread.rs).
    Correctness fix, no option: #1 and #2 fail on the unpatched engine.
-->
